.wiki/ holds the index cache's runtime artifacts: the sqlite DB and its sidecars live under wiki_dir/index_db_path, the refresh lock at .wiki/wiki-refresh.lock, and perf logs land at the repo root as wiki.log. .gitignore ignores that exact set, and the lock and path helpers pin the same names in code. Adding or renaming any artifact requires updating all sites in lockstep.
